key "DFN1993"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 is the most detailed in common use among researchers,
 but remains far too complex to deploy in practical controls.
 To address this issue,
 a number of physics-based reduced-order models (ROMs) have been proposed (
\emph on
cf
\emph default
.
